*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0044
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-09-17 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 958
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0044.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> TRANSACTIONS IN LAST 24 HOURS
    05 WS-TCNT            PIC 9(3).
    *> TRANSACTION AMOUNT
    05 T-AMT1             PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> DAYS SINCE ACCOUNT OPENED
    05 A-OD               PIC 9(5).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> RISK LEVEL H/M/L
    05 RL-CD              PIC X VALUE 'L'.
    *> FRAUD RISK SCORE
    05 RS-SC              PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM SCORE-VELOCITY
    DISPLAY "RL-CD=" RL-CD
    DISPLAY "RS-SC=" RS-SC
    STOP RUN.
SCORE-VELOCITY.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> VERY HIGH TRANSACTION VELOCITY
        WHEN WS-TCNT > 25
           AND T-AMT1 GREATER THAN 2000
            MOVE 'H' TO RL-CD
            MOVE 90 TO RS-SC
        *> ELEVATED TRANSACTION VELOCITY
        WHEN WS-TCNT > 6
            MOVE 'M' TO RL-CD
            MOVE 60 TO RS-SC
        *> ACTIVITY ON NEW ACCOUNT
        WHEN A-OD < 90
            MOVE 'M' TO RL-CD
            MOVE 40 TO RS-SC
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'L' TO RL-CD
            MOVE 10 TO RS-SC
    END-EVALUATE.
